Nanba Shrine is a [[Shinto Shrine]] in [[Osaka]]. It worships [[Emperor Nintoku]].<ref name=":0">{{Cite web|title=Namba Shrine|url=https://osaka-info.jp/en/spot/nanbajinja|access-date=2024-01-05|website=OSAKA INFO|language=en}}</ref> It was made by Nintoku's son [[Emperor Hanzei]].<ref name=":0" />

It has a summer festivasl on July 20th and 21st.<ref name=":0" />

Some people think it was the [[Soja shrine]] of [[Settsu Province]]. Soja shrines are shrines where all the [[kami]] of a province can be worshipped at once.

